# LENS COMPONENT MAPPING

## Instead of HTML elements, use:

| Need           | ❌ NEVER                   | ✅ ALWAYS                                           |
|----------------|---------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
| Container      | `<div>`                   | `<Container>` from lens                             |
| Flex layout    | `display: flex` divs      | `<Split>` from lens                                 |
| Vertical stack | Flex column divs          | `<Split direction="column">` from lens              |
| Grid layout    | `display: grid` divs      | `<Arrange>` from lens                               |
| Page title     | `<h1>`                    | `<Text size="heading-lg" htmlTag="h1">`             |
| Section head   | `<h2>`, `<h3>`            | `<Text size="heading-md" htmlTag="h2">`             |
| Paragraph      | `<p>`                     | `<Text htmlTag="p">`                                |
| Inline text    | `<span>`                  | `<Text htmlTag="span">` or `<Text isInline>`        |
| Button         | `<button>`                | `<Button>` from lens                                |
| Link           | `<a>`                     | `<Link>` from lens                                  |
| Text input     | `<input>`                 | `<TextInput>` from lens                             |
| Select         | `<select>`                | `<Select>` from lens                                |
| Textarea       | `<textarea>`              | `<Textarea>` from lens                              |
| Checkbox       | `<input type="checkbox">` | `<Checkbox>` from lens                              |
| Radio          | `<input type="radio">`    | `<Radio>` from lens                                 |
| Form wrapper   | `<form>` + labels         | `<Container htmlTag="form">` + `<FormField>`        |
| Separator      | `<hr>`                    | `<Container borderSide="bottom">`                   |
| Image          | `<img>`                   | `<Container htmlTag="img">` or use as appropriate   |
| List           | `<ul>/<ol>`               | `<List>` from lens or `<Arrange htmlTag="ul">`      |
| Nav            | `<nav>`                   | `<Split htmlTag="nav">` or `<Container htmlTag="nav">` |
| Section        | `<section>`               | `<Container htmlTag="section">`                     |
| Header         | `<header>`                | `<Container htmlTag="header">`                      |
| Footer         | `<footer>`                | `<Container htmlTag="footer">`                      |
| Main           | `<main>`                  | `<Container htmlTag="main">`                        |

## Button Variants (use these exact strings)
neutral, neutralSecondary, primary, secondary, record, upgrade, danger, ai

## Button Sizes (use these exact strings)
small, medium, large

## Text Sizes (use these exact strings)
body-sm, body-md, body-lg, heading-sm, heading-md, heading-lg
